&lt;summary&gt;🟡 Minor comments (25)&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;

**app/poltergeist_app/lib/main.dart:58 - `PoltergeistApp` arguments trimmed; constructor must match**
**Problem:** The `runApp` call no longer passes `debugDemoEnabled` or `probeSettings`, but this chunk doesn't include the `PoltergeistApp` widget definition, so we can't confirm its constructor was updated in lockstep.
**Impact:** If the widget still declares either parameter as required, this is an immediate compile error at the boot site. If they're optional with retained behavior, probe/demo wiring could regress silently.
**Suggested fix:**
```diff
  // lib/app.dart (or wherever PoltergeistApp lives) — drop the removed params
  const PoltergeistApp({
    super.key,
    required this.initialPaneRatio,
-   required this.debugDemoEnabled,
-   required this.probeSettings,
    required this.bookmarks,
    ...
  });
```
